  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LO TCO Bist&#xe5;ndsn&#xe4;mnd Informations och Kommunikationsanslag f&#xf6;r 2013.   Bist&#xe5;ndsn&#xe4;mnden arbetar mef fackliga r&#xe4;ttigheter i ett 60-tal        l&#xe4;nder.                                                                Dess informationsarbete fokuserar p&#xe5; tre komponenter. a) Allm&#xe4;n      information till medlemmar och f&#xf6;rbud avseende fackliga r&#xe4;ttigheter   generellt.   b) Schyst Resande    c)Fair Trade</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LO-TCO Secretariat Information Grant 2013. The secretariat is an      Umbrella body for the Swedish Union movement, channeling Sida funding to various Swedish Unions, supporting Unions in some 60 countries.     The infomration work incorporates three components, a) Generals      information work related to international Union matters  b) Fair      travel business    c) Fair Trade</narrative>
  </description>
